      'Set up Evilginx2 on a local test environment to understand real-time phishing proxy attacks against MFA. Configure a phishlet for a local test application, perform the attack to capture both credentials and session cookies, and document the complete attack flow. Then research how FIDO2/WebAuthn prevents this attack.',
      'Create a comprehensive authentication test checklist with at least 20 test cases covering: login (brute force, lockout, enumeration), sessions (fixation, cookie flags, concurrent sessions, logout), MFA (bypass, enrollment, recovery codes), and password reset (token predictability, expiration, reuse). Use this checklist to audit OWASP Juice Shop.',
