      'Use Turbo Intruder to test a rate-limited endpoint on a local application. Configure the endpoint to allow 5 requests per minute. Send 20 requests using single-packet attack and measure how many get through. Then implement rate limiting using Redis INCR with EXPIRE (atomic operation) instead of a read-then-increment pattern, and retest.',
